<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Privacy Policy | Vibely</title>

<style>
    .policy-page {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 60px auto;
        padding: 0 24px 80px;
        color: #222;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .policy-header {
        margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .policy-header h1 {
        font-size: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .policy-header p {
        color: #666;
    }

    .policy-section {
        margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .policy-section h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .policy-section h3 {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .policy-section ul {
        padding-left: 24px;
    }

    .policy-section li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .policy-date {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #777;
    }
</style>
```

</head>

<body>

<main class="policy-page">
<header class="policy-header">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
        Your privacy matters to us. This Privacy Policy explains how
        Vibely collects, uses, stores, and protects information when
        you use our website and services.
    </p>

    <p class="policy-date">
        Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN') %>
    </p>
</header>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>1. About Vibely</h2>

    <p>
        Vibely is an online property rental and listing platform that
        allows users to discover, view, and interact with property
        listings and related services.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

    <p>
        Depending on how you use Vibely, we may collect the following
        information:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Name and account information.</li>
        <li>Email address and contact information.</li>
        <li>Login and authentication information.</li>
        <li>Property listing information submitted by users.</li>
        <li>Location information associated with listings.</li>
        <li>Reviews, ratings, and other content submitted by users.</li>
        <li>Information required to process transactions or requests.</li>
        <li>Technical information such as IP address, browser type, device information, and usage data.</li>
    </ul>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>

    <p>
        We may use collected information to:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Create and manage user accounts.</li>
        <li>Provide and operate Vibely's services.</li>
        <li>Display and manage property listings.</li>
        <li>Process requests and transactions.</li>
        <li>Provide customer support.</li>
        <li>Send important service-related communications.</li>
        <li>Prevent fraud, abuse, and unauthorized activity.</li>
        <li>Improve website functionality and user experience.</li>
        <li>Maintain security and troubleshoot technical problems.</li>
        <li>Comply with applicable legal requirements.</li>
    </ul>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>4. Account Information</h2>

    <p>
        You are responsible for providing accurate information when
        creating an account and for keeping your login credentials
        confidential.
    </p>

    <p>
        If you believe that your account has been accessed without
        authorization, you should contact us as soon as possible.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>5. Property Listings and User Content</h2>

    <p>
        Information, images, descriptions, reviews, ratings, and other
        content submitted by users may be displayed on Vibely.
    </p>

    <p>
        Users are responsible for ensuring that content they submit is
        accurate, lawful, and does not infringe the rights of others.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>6. Location Information</h2>

    <p>
        Vibely may process location information provided in connection
        with property listings or searches. Location data may be used
        to provide map functionality, search results, and relevant
        property information.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>7. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>

    <p>
        Vibely may use cookies, sessions, local storage, and similar
        technologies to maintain authentication, remember preferences,
        improve functionality, and understand how the website is used.
    </p>

    <p>
        Disabling certain cookies or browser storage may affect some
        website functionality.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2>

    <p>
        Vibely may use third-party services for functions such as
        hosting, image storage, mapping, geocoding, authentication,
        analytics, payments, or email communication.
    </p>

    <p>
        These providers may process information according to their own
        privacy policies and applicable agreements.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>9. Data Security</h2>

    <p>
        We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to
        protect information from unauthorized access, alteration,
        disclosure, or destruction.
    </p>

    <p>
        However, no internet-based service can guarantee absolute
        security.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>10. Data Retention</h2>

    <p>
        We retain information for as long as reasonably necessary to
        provide our services, maintain business records, resolve
        disputes, prevent abuse, comply with legal obligations, and
        enforce our agreements.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>11. Your Choices</h2>

    <p>
        Depending on applicable law and the nature of the information,
        you may have rights to access, update, correct, or request
        deletion of certain personal information.
    </p>

    <p>
        You may contact us regarding privacy-related requests using
        the contact information provided on our website.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>12. Children's Privacy</h2>

    <p>
        Vibely is not intended for children who are not legally
        permitted to use the service. We do not knowingly collect
        personal information from children in violation of applicable
        law.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>13. Changes to This Policy</h2>

    <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
        Changes will be posted on this page with an updated
        "Last updated" date.
    </p>
</section>


<section class="policy-section">
    <h2>14. Contact Us</h2>

    <p>
        If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this
        Privacy Policy, please contact Vibely through the contact
        information provided on our website.
    </p>
</section>

</main>

</body>
</html>
